ning UX recommendations into concrete code changes.</p><div class="skill-hero-note"><strong>MIT-0</strong> · <!-- -->Free to use, modify, and redistribute. No attribution required.</div><div class="stat">⭐ <!-- -->99<!-- --> · <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-package" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z"></path><path d="M12 22V12"></path><polyline points="3.29 7 12 12 20.71 7"></polyline><path d="m7.5 4.27 9 5.15"></path></svg> <!-- -->19.7k<!-- --> · <!-- -->223<!-- --> <!-- -->current installs · <!-- -->233<!-- --> all-time installs</div><div class="stat"><span class="user-badge user-badge-md"><span class="user-badge-prefix">by</span><span class="user-avatar" aria-hidden="true"><img class="user-avatar-img" src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143898661?v=4" alt="" loading="lazy"/></span><a class="user-handle" href="/u/xobi667">@xobi667</a></span></div><div class="tag tag-accent">MIT-0</div><div class="skill-actions"></div><div class="scan-results-panel"><div class="scan-results-title">Security Scan</div><div class="scan-results-list"><div class="scan-result-row"><div class="scan-result-scanner"><svg class="scan-result-icon scan-result-icon-vt" width="1em" height="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 89" aria-label="VirusTotal"><title>VirusTotal</title><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M45.292 44.5 0 89h100V0H0l45.292 44.5zM90 80H22l35.987-35.2L22 9h68v71z"></path></svg><span class="scan-result-scanner-name">VirusTotal</span></div><div class="scan-result-status scan-status-clean">Benign</div><a href="https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/723568514fbc12dcac9094d35ffa844d9904e27114e4982b9cba4620d6ed0c20" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" clas